## Appendix

**Tragedy of commons**

A database responses to multiple micro service queries works only when microservices treat the database as a shared resource and limit the number of queries preventing the collapse of the db entirely. A tragedy of the commons. This problem doesn't save itself.

**Dominant Strategy**

A dominant strategy –&nbsp;is the trap that most companies fall into causing a prisoner's dilemma.

